    skos:scopeNote "Overkoepelende categorie voor de in de Annex van (EU) 2022/670 opgesomde regulaties en beperkingen die samen een circulatieplan vormen. Technisch model: DATEX II TrafficRegulation (EN 16157 / CEN/TS 16157-11)."@nl .

<https://xcalibur1978.github.io/temp/id/460df05c-6ddc-4bbf-b868-b606870a4cc6> a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dct:created "2026-06-04T17:56:24.678942+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:description "SKOS concept scheme for the priority data type 'traffic circulation plan' under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2022/670 (RTTI), supplementing ITS Directive 2010/40/EU as amended by Directive (EU) 2023/2661. The plan-level concept is the single top concept; constituent regulation and zone concepts are arranged beneath it. Definitions follow the authoritative source wording (legally enumerated data types are normative per the Annex of (EU) 2022/670; prose definitions from the NAPCORE ITS Data Dictionary are indicative). Concepts that have a canonical home in a sibling RTTI scheme are referenced via rdfs:seeAlso rather than duplicated."@en,
        "test"@nl ;
    dct:modified "2026-06-11T13:31:49.975582+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:title "RTTI — Traffic Circulation Plans"@en,
        "RTTI — Verkeerscirculatieplannen"@nl ;
